OL,3,GNEWSAFlat residents unconvinced by
OL,4,Alatest cladding move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residents' association said it felt
OL,7,F"no sense of relief" despite a
OL,8,Fdeveloper taking the latest step
OL,9,Ftowards replacing combustible cladding
OL,10,Fon an apartment complex.
OL,12,FBarratt Redrow has submitted plans to
OL,13,Fcreate a compound for construction
OL,14,Fmaterials off South Row in Milton
OL,15,FKeynes, ahead of works on the city's
OL,16,FVizion Apartments.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
