OL,3,GNEWSAFlat residents unconvinced by
OL,4,Alatest cladding move
OL,5,
OL,6,FCiting a number of delays to the
OL,7,Fremediation work, Ann Savell, chair of
OL,8,Fthe Vizion MK Residents' Association,
OL,9,Fsaid: "Until they put up the
OL,10,Fscaffolding and get builders on site, I
OL,11,Fwon't believe that work's ever going to
OL,12,Fstart."
OL,14,FThe developer said it was "doing
OL,15,Feverything we can to complete
OL,16,Fremediation as quickly as possible".
